@startuml BLE States
hide empty description

title BLE Session State

state Off
Off: Stack not active
Off: No advertising

state Advertising
Advertising: Broadcasting presence
Advertising: Waiting for watch to connect

state Connected
Connected: Watch paired
Connected: Clock sync active
Connected: No ride in progress

state "Live Streaming" as Streaming
Streaming: Ride in progress
Streaming: Data queued and batched to watch
Streaming: Clock sync active

state Draining
Draining: Ride ended
Draining: No new data accepted
Draining: Remaining queued data sent

[*] -d-> Off
Off -d-> Advertising : ride task starts
Advertising -d-> Connected : watch connects
Connected -u-> Advertising : watch disconnects
Connected -d-> Streaming : capture begins
Streaming -r-> Draining : ride ends
Streaming -u-> Advertising : watch disconnects mid-ride\nqueued data is dropped
Draining -u-> Off : drain complete, ride task exits

@enduml
